<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">Colosse-te</book>
  <para style="h">Colosse-te</para>
  <para style="toc1">Colosse-te</para>
  <para style="toc2">Colosse-te</para>
  <para style="mt">Colosse-te</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien’ deina bangin Khris Jesu sawltahpi Paul le i sanggampa Timothy in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Colosse khuopi-a om Khris sunga misiengthote le a citah sanggamte tungah: Note tungah i Pasien tung panin hepina le lungmuonna hing om taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khris Jesu sunga na upna ule misiengthote zosie na itna uh ahi a, note dinga vantunga ang kikholpieh lametna thute ahi zongin za zo ka hi ziehun note adingin i Topa Jesu Khris’ Pa Pasien tungah lungdamna kang kopieh zing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na tung vua ang tung tua lungdamna thu in leitung buppi-ah a ga suongin a khan ma bangin, note in zong thuman thutah sungah Pasien’ hepina thu za-in na thei tahtah ni vua kipanin note lahah ga a ga zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tam thu pen note in ka it ka naseppi uh Epaphras kung pana na zahsa uh ahi hi. Ama pen note tanga Khris’ nasem muonhuoi khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hlagau sungah itna na neinate uzong ama in ei theisah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tami thu ziehin na thu uh ka zah ni vua kipanin, hlagau lam pilna le theitelna zosie nei-in Pasien’ deina theitheina tawh na kidim nadingun thu kang ngetpieh zing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n note in Topa’ deina bang ahi hinkhuote mang thei-in ama na lungkimsah bukim ding vua, sil hoi namkimah zong ga suongin Pasien’ thutheina-ah na khang semsem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kipahtahin lungduoina tawh sil bangkim thuoh dingin kithawi a, khuovah sungah misiengthote tawh note gou ang luotonsah thei Pa tungah lungdamna na ko thei nadingun, a minthang ama’ vanglietna in thahatna zosie tawh hing thakhausah ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in khuomiel thuneina gam panin eite ei hunkhie-in, a it a Tapa gam sungah ei koi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />eite in ama sungah tatkhietna le maw kimaisahnate i nei uhi .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama pen mu thei lo Pasien’ lim hi a, a kipiengsah zosiete lahah a pieng masa pen ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile ama sungah vantung le leitunga om nate, a kimuthei le a kimuthei lo nate, kumpi tophate, ahi sihle uhnate, ahi sihle gam-uhte, ahi sihle vanglietnate kisiem hi, ama ading le ama tungtawnin sil bangkim kisiem zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sil bangkim a op masang in Ama a om zo ta bo a, ama sungah sil bangkim a kizom dimdiem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama pen hlattuom pawlpi ahi pumpi’ lutang ahi hi; sil bangkimah a tungnung pen ahi thei nadingin ama a kipatna le misite lah panin a kithokiasah tacil ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile ama sungah Pasien’ bukimna zosie a ten ding pen Pa lungkimna hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />ama tungtawnin ama tawh lei le vana sil bangkim kilemsahin, a singlamte sisan tungtawnin kilemna ei bawlpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hun khat lai-in lungsim gilo-in na gamtat siet ziehun Pasien tawh na kigamla vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />tu-in ahile ama mai-ah a siengtho, nuol om lo le muhkawna om loin sina tungtawnin ama’ tahsa pumpi sungah ang lemtuo zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua khu na zahsa uh lungdamna thu in note ang kamciem lametna panin kihei loin, na upna uh na zop suoh uleh cina hi a, vansin nei-a a om a kipiengsah zosiete tungah a kitangko hi. Keima Paul zong tam lungdamna thu’ nasem khat ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tu-in keima in note dinga ka thuoh gimnate-ah ka lung a dam a, ka tahsa-a ka thuoh gimnate tawh hlattuom pawlpi ahi ama’ pumpi tangin Khris in a thuoh ding a kisam lai teng thuohin a bukimsah ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pasien’ thu a kicing tahin a kithei nadingin note adingin keima tunga ei kipie Pasien’ sawlna dung zui-in a nasem pa khat ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua thuthuh pen a khangkhangin na kiselcip nanle tu hunin ama’ misiengthote tungah ang kipholah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pasien in tami a minthang thuthuh haunate bangza-in lien ahei, ci Gentile-te le amate tungah a theisah dingin keima ei teel a, note sunga om Khris pen tua thuthuh a minthang lametna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khris sungah mi zosie a picingsa-a ka pieh thei nadingun pilna namkim tawh mi vannuoi tungah genkholin, thu hilin ka tangko pen uh ama ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tami thu adingin Khris in keima sunga ei guot ahi ka thahatna teng zosie tawh na semin ka hanciem hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile note le Laodicia khuomite a kipanin ka maitang ei mu ngai nai lo mi zosie adingin keima in bangza-in hanciemin sem ka hei, ci na thei ding uh ka dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A lungsim sung vuah amate kihanthawnin itna sungah kipumkhat a, tuaci’n amate in hauna kicing theitelna bukim le, Khris mama ahi Pasien’ thu thuhpi theina a nei ding uh ka dei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ama sungah pilna le theina gougil zosie kiphuolin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thu hoi lim a sut mawh vangin thuman lote tawh koima in note ang sol zo lo nadinga tami thu kang gen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ka pumpi tawh kang oppi sih vangin Hlagau sungah kang oppi veve a, na lungsim puoh dante ule Khris sungah a kip na upna uh ka mu ciengin ka kipah mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin note in Khris Jesu Topa na sansa uh ahi ma bangin na hinkhuote uh ama sungah nungta suoh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ang kihilsa bang tehtehin ama sungah zunghla-in, kilamin upna-ah na bulkip unlen, a kicing lungdamkona na nei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khris’ deina dan tawh a kituoh lo, mihingte’ tang ngainate le leitung a uh hlagaute’ dei dan tawh a kituoh thuthuh ngaisutnate le a hawmpi ahi kisolnate tungtawnin koima in note sala ang mat lo nadingin kikem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama’ pumpi-ah Pasien’ pienzie bukim om a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />note in a uhte le aana neite zosie’ lutang ahi ama sungah hinna bukim na nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Note zong Khris’ teptanna sungah cilesa pumpi suokhie-in khut tawh a kitan ahi lo, hlagau teptanna tawh ama sungah tep kitansa na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Baptize-na sungah Khris tawh na kivuiton ciengun sina panin ama a thosah Pasien’ vanglietna sungah upna tungtawnin note zong ama tawh ang thotonsah kia ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na khielnate ule na cilesa teptannate sung vuah na si lai-un Pasien in ama tawh a hington dingin note ang bawl a, na khielna zosie uh ang ngaidam lai-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ama in eite langah thukham’ ei kalh ciemtena laite phietmangin hemkhie dawh a, singlamte tungah a kildet ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in a uhte le thuneite gal lelsah a, singlamte hang tawh tuate tungah a guolzo a, mipi’ ette dingin tuate a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin anneh tuidawn ahi a, biehna pawite, hladet pawite, le sabbath tanna thute-ah ahi zongin, na tung vuah koima in thu na khensah sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tamte pen ang tung ding nate’ hlim beh ahi a, a tahtah pen Khris hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in mangmuna a mu ziehun a thupi deu-in a kingaisun vua, tuaci’n a dih lo kiniemkhiehna le vantung mite bieh ding a paugen mite khatpo in na thaman uh na tan nadingun kibawlsah sih un. Tua bang mite pen a hang om lopi-in mihing’ ngaisutna tawh a kimot phatsah uh ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tua a lutang pen a tudet sih uhi, tua panin pumpi na zosie in thahatna nga-in, gu le tangte le thahuite tawh kizom dimdiem a, Pasien kung pana khanna tawh a khangto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khris tawh leitung thungehte a sisa na hi tah uleh, bang dingin leitung tawh kipawl bangin nungta lai na hi uh ahei? Bang dingin note in tam bang ngainate ahi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tham sin, ciem sin, khoi kha sin, ci thute mang na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tam ngaina zosie pen eite tawh a kisietha ding nate a genna hi a, tuate pen mihingte’ thupieh le thuhilnate hi lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tamte pen bawltawm biehna, kiniemkhiehna, le tahsa genthei bawlnate a khangsah pilna tawh a kibah vangin nop banga gamtatna kham nadingin kimanna a nei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaci’n Khris tawh a thoto zo na hi tah uleh, note in Pasien’ zietlam kumpi topha tunga a to Khris opna mun ahi tunglam nate sui-in nei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Leitunga om nate tungah na lungsim uh nga sih unlen, tunglam a om nate tungah nga un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />azieh pen note na si zo ta vua, na hinna uh Khris tawh Pasien sungah kiphuoltonin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Note’ hinna ahi Khris ang kilah ciengin note zong ama’ minthanna sungah ama tawh na kilahton ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin na tahsa sung vua om numei-pasal pahtatna, siengtho lona, huana lanna, gitlo deigawna, le milim biehna ahi huoihamna-a kipan leitung sil poma na thatlia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam teng ziehin mi thunung lote tungah Pasien’ lungthahna a tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hun khat lai-in note zong tam bang gamtatnate tawh a nungta ngaite na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hizongle tu-in na kam sung panun tua bang nate ahi, lungthahna, thangpaina, mudana, mindaisahna, le kam gilo poma na paimang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hindan lui le gamtatna luite a suokhiesa na hi lam uh kithei-in khatlekhat kisol sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Note pen ang piengsah pa’ lim le mel tawh kisunin theitelna lamah a kibawltha ahi mitha silte na hi ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua thasuona sungah Gentile-te le Jew mite, teptan le teptan lote, nam tuolte, Scythia-te, silate le sila lote ci bang a om nawn sih hi; hizongle Khris pen bangkim ahi a, bangkimah ama a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Note pen Pasien’ teelsa a siengtho le a ithuoite na hi ma bangun lainatna, migitna, kiniemkhiehna, lungnemna le lungduoina-te na sil un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi khatpo in adang khat tungah mawsah nading a nei leh khatlekhat kithuoh zo-in na kimaisah un. Topa in note’ mawna ang maisah bangin note zong khatlekhat maw na kimaisah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tamte zosie tungah note in sil bangkim kihuol taha a khiton itna na sil un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pumkhat ahi dinga note ang hlan Khris’ kilemna in na lungtang na uhsah unlen, kipah tahin na om un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Note sungah Khris’ thu kicingtahin tengsah un; pilna bukim tawh khatlekhat thu kihilin na kisam un; na lungtang vuah lungdamna tawh Pasien tungah phatna late, biehna late, le hlagau late na sa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na hamna vuah ahi a, na gamtatna vuah ahi zongin Topa Jesu’ minin sil bangkim na bawl unlen, ama tungtawnin Pa Pasien tungah lungdam na ko un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zite aw, Topa sunga na bawl ding uh a kilawm ahi ma bangin na pasalte’ thu na mang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pasalte aw, na zite it unlen amate tungah sitsie lungham vapual ngai sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tate aw, sil bangkimah na nu na pate thu na mang un, azieh pen tam pen Topa sungah a bawltah na nasep uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pate aw, na tate uh thangpaisah sih un, tua hi sihle amate ang lungkie kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Silate aw, sil bangkimah leitung na pute uh’ thu na mang un, ang kimu sung beh ule amate lungkim thei nadinga thumang hi loin, Topa na zatahna ziehun na lungsimtahpi utawh thu mang na hizaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na sepna khat popo vuah na pute uh’ nasem bangin na kingaisun sih unlen, Topa adinga nasem bangin na kingaisun un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa tung panin thaman dingin gouluo na nga ding uhi, ci na thei uhi; note pen Topa Khris’ nasemte na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Azieh pen deisahtuom om loin, a bawlkhiel na khatpo ziehin tua khielna bawlpa tungah kithuhkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pute aw, na silate uh dihtah le kilawmtahin na bawl un, azieh pen note in zong vantungah pu khat na nei lam na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kikemcing kawmin lungdamkona tawh thunget na pawnthaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khris’ thuthuh zieha thongkie ka hi a, Pasien in kot ei honpiehin tua thu ka phuongzah thei nading le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />keima in ka hil ding bangin a kicien taha ka hil thei nadingin tu mama-in kote adingin zong thu ei na ngetpieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pulam mite tungah na gamtat zie uh pilvang unlen, hun hoi na nga zosie uh na zah siem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mikim tungah bangci dawn dinga kilawm ahei, ci na thei nadingun na kamham uh nemsah zingin ci bangin na alsah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tychicus in kei vai thutha zosie note kungah ang gen ding hi; ama pen Topa sunga ka it sanggampa, nasem muonhuoi, le ka naseppi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kote pen bangci bang ka hi uh ahei ci nei thei nading ule na lungnop thei nading uh ngimna tawh na kung vua ama kang sawl ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />note lahah khat ahi a muonhuoi, i it sanggampa Onesimus zong ama tawh ang zawh hi. Ama gel in tam sunga thupieng zosie na kung vuah ang gen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Barnabas’ tupa Mark in ang noset bangin ka thongkiehpi Aristarchus in zong ang noset uhi, a thu kang gen na zahsa uh ahi hi, ama ang pei leh na na dawn un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Justus a kici Jesu in zong ang noset uhi. Pasien’ manggam adinga ka naseppite lahah tam teng pen tep kitan a omsun teng hi a, kei adingin amate pen ka hlamuonna ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Note lahah Khris Jesu’ nasem khat ahi Epaphras in ang noset uhi. Ama pen note picingin na dinkip nading ule Pasien’ deina zosie a bukima na telcien thei nadingun note tangin nahpitaha thu ang ngetpieh zing pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Azieh pen ama in note ading le Laodicea khuo le Hierapolis khuo-a om mite adingin na a hasepna thu keima a teci ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eite in i it mama uh sievuonpa Luke le Demas in zong ang noset uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Laodicea-a sanggamte, Nympha le ama’ inn a kikhawm hlattuom pawlpi mite ei na noset pieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na lah vuah tu-a kang laihlah na sim zaw ciengun Laodicea khuo-a om hlattuom pawlpi mite tungah na simsah un; Laodicea pana ki-at lai zong na simthuo pai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuale Archippus kungah, “ Topa sunga na nga nasep zo sieng in,” ci-in na gen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tami hopina lai pen keima Paul in ka khut mama tawh ka giel ahi hi. Ei kikolbulna thu na phawh zing un. Note tawh hepina hing om taheh.
  </para>
</usx>
